  {
   "type": "pub-curated-gallery",
   "title": "节省空间的办公桌",
   "texts": [
    "/cat/47147",
    "NO",
    "ikea://content/plp?catalogId=47147",
    "{\"objectId_var\":\"47147\",\"objectType_var\":\"plp\"}",
    "这张桌子外形紧凑，尤其适合狭小空间。翻盖设计，将所有电线隐藏起来，保持桌面整洁。配置的抽屉也十分方便，工作结束时，将笔记本电脑和电线统统放入抽屉。告别工作，明天再见！",
    "节省空间的办公桌"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/2c8b397c61ee94c7/original/PH176888-crop001.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "/cat/47147",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/2c8b397c61ee94c7/original/PH176888-crop001.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "",
     "text": "一张细窄的白色桌子，带两个抽屉，其中一个抽屉拉开，里面放着一台贴着贴纸的笔记本电脑，还有一些电线。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/2c8b397c61ee94c7/original/PH176888-crop001.jpg",
     "href": null,
     "backgroundColor": null
    }
   ],
