  {
   "type": "pub-curated-gallery",
   "title": "办公储物更轻松",
   "texts": [
    "/cat/10711",
    "NO",
    "ikea://content/plp?catalogId=10711",
    "{\"objectId_var\":\"10711\",\"objectType_var\":\"plp\"}",
    "带标签的抽屉有助你有条不紊地归整所有文件和办公室配件。对于尺寸较大的纸张和其他大件物品，那就交给带脚轮的抽屉柜吧。",
    "办公储物更轻松"
   ],
   "images": [
    "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/57f5eb00f271924d/original/PH176890-crop001.jpg"
   ],
   "links": [
    {
     "href": "/cat/10711",
     "text": ""
    },
    {
     "href": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/57f5eb00f271924d/original/PH176890-crop001.jpg",
     "text": ""
    }
   ],
   "items": [
    {
     "title": "",
     "text": "墙上有两块白色搁板，上面放着储物件和书；还有一个时钟、一个高高的白色抽屉柜、一个宽大的带脚轮木制抽屉柜。",
     "image": "https://file.app.ikea.cn/ext/ingkadam/m/57f5eb00f271924d/original/PH176890-crop001.jpg",
     "href": null,
     "backgroundColor": null
